Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After the ecstasy\N欢愉之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.89,0:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Testing for pregnancy\N验孕测试
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Praying in MP3\N用MP3祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to let you see into the whole machine\N我害怕让你窥见整个机器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,leave it all on the field\N将一切留在原野
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your metal detector hits my precious treasure\N你的金属探测器击中我珍视的宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nobody's daughter Yeah\N我无人之女 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,baby, I'm free, I'm free\N亲爱的 我自由了 自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Free, I'm free\N自由 我自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But deep in my matter, you're changing my patterns\N但你深入我的血肉 篡改我的基因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your helix is right through me\N你的基因链贯穿我身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bars on my windows, you bust them wide open\N窗棂的牢笼 被你彻底击碎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,'Til clearness is all I see\N直至清澈成为唯一风景
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try letting the answer be part of the dance as I trip and I stumble\N跌倒踉跄时 我尝试让答案融入舞步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby, I'm free, I'm free\N是的 亲爱的 我自由了 自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free\N我自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Lips 'round your halo, you asked where I came from\N唇瓣轻触你光环 你问我从何而来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied and then I came clean\N我撒谎 而后坦白真相
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's broken blood in me\N我体内流淌破碎的血脉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it passed through my mother from her mother down to me\N从外祖母传给母亲 再渗透进我身体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel you answer, my hips moving faster, I rode you until I cried\N感受你的回应 腰肢愈加剧烈 骑乘直至泪涌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it feel being this alive?\N如此活着是何感受？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha\N哈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?\N它去向何处？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, Wish I'd kept the Clearblue\N哈 多希望我留着可丽蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd remember how it feels to\N我会记得那种感受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Be so bare in the throes\N在阵痛中袒露无遗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wish I'd kept the Clearblue\N噢 多希望我留着可丽蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd remember how it feels to be\N我会记得存在的感受